1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 Nf6 4. Nc3?! { Develops, but the pawn on e4 is now guarded only by this knight. } 4... Nxe4 5. Nxe4 d5 { The fork: the pawn attacks both the bishop and the knight. } 6. Bd3 dxe4 7. Bxe4 *
